@hint listDataAssets List data_assets
@hint registerDataAsset Register a data_asset
@hint readDataAsset Read a single data_asset
@hint listDataUseManifests List data_use_manifests
@hint registerDataUseManifest Register a data_use_manifest
@hint readDataUseManifest Read a single data_use_manifest
